# Witness: a review record stating an item count the worksheet does not bear out

The number of worksheet items is not an enumeration and cannot be - the worksheet grows. It is
held by agreement between two documents instead, so that deleting an item and correcting the
worksheet's own two number cells no longer leaves everything true. This fragment is read
against the real worksheet, which carries thirty-five.

## 4. Review Route

The worksheet carries 34 items, contiguous from `RC-01`, one or more for each of the eight
areas below.

| ID | Area | What a defect here would cost | Suggested time |
|---|---|---|---|
| RA-1 | Bounded reading of untrusted bytes | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-2 | Resource authority and budgets | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-3 | Lifecycle and state machine | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-4 | Verified-artifact ownership | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-5 | Guest-initiated loads and external suspension | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-6 | The public contract surface | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-7 | The records themselves | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
| RA-8 | The evidence and the rule register | A defect here is expensive. | 45 min |
